VALUES ('ET50', 'EPITHALON', '50mg', 'Tetrapeptide · Telomerase Activator · ≥99% purity · For laboratory research use only', 'EPITHALON (50mg) is a synthetic peptide analog of epitalon, a naturally occurring peptide fragment that has been studied for its potential role in regulating circadian rhythms and modulating oxidative stress responses in various cellular models. This research peptide is used to investigate the effects of epitalon on cellular aging, senescence, and stress resistance in vitro and in vivo, providing valuable insights into the mechanisms underlying aging and age-related diseases.', 119, 0, 5, 0, 'data:image/jpeg;base64,', 'purity', 'storage', 'form', 'cc', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
