VALUES ('FN1', 'FOLLISTATIN', '1mg', 'Recombinant Follistatin Protein · Activin/Myostatin Antagonist · ≥99% purity · For laboratory research use only', 'FOLLISTATIN (1mg) is a potent inhibitor of myostatin, a negative regulator of muscle growth, making it a valuable tool for studying muscle hypertrophy and myogenesis in vitro and in vivo. This peptide hormone has been widely used in research to investigate the molecular mechanisms underlying muscle growth and development, and to explore its potential applications in muscle-related diseases and disorders.', 119, 0, 5, 0, 'data:image/jpeg;base64,', 'purity', 'storage', 'form', 'cc', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
